  <data key="d12">1779777466</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Free Order Cancellation" target="Duplicate Charge">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Free order cancellation is used to resolve duplicate charges when the online order is unpaid.</data>
  <data key="d9">resolution,scenario</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-2b3a06f7135e2b57c94c1307b69cc5a4-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">网约公交客服管理·商户培训手册V20250905.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1779777465</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Free Order Cancellation" target="Charge Without Ride">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Free order cancellation is applied when a passenger was charged without taking the ride and the online order is unpaid.</data>
  <data key="d9">resolution,scenario</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-2b3a06f7135e2b57c94c1307b69cc5a4-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">网约公交客服管理·商户培训手册V20250905.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1779777466</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Driver" target="Charge Without Ride">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Charge without ride may be caused by driver misoperation, such as ending a trip without the passenger boarding.</data>
  <data key="d9">causation,involvement</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-2b3a06f7135e2b57c94c1307b69cc5a4-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">网约公交客服管理·商户培训手册V20250905.pdf</data>
