  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Driver Service Issue" target="Standard Script">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Standard script is used to initially respond to driver service issues, calming the passenger while investigation proceeds.</data>
  <data key="d9">appeasement,response</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-2b3a06f7135e2b57c94c1307b69cc5a4-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">网约公交客服管理·商户培训手册V20250905.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1779777466</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Early Drop-off Fare Issue" target="网约公交">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Early drop-off fare issue stems from the fixed fare policy of网约公交, where fares do not change even if the passenger alights early.</data>
  <data key="d9">fixed fare,policy</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-2b3a06f7135e2b57c94c1307b69cc5a4-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">网约公交客服管理·商户培训手册V20250905.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1779777466</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Early Drop-off Fare Issue" target="Standard Script">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Standard script is used to respond to passengers regarding early drop-off fare issues, explaining the fixed fare policy and suggesting negotiation with the driver.</data>
  <data key="d9">customer service,response</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-2b3a06f7135e2b57c94c1307b69cc5a4-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">网约公交客服管理·商户培训手册V20250905.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1779777466</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Early Drop-off Fare Issue" target="公交公司">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The final handling of early drop-off fare issues, especially when the passenger strongly disagrees, is determined by the bus company (公交公司).</data>
  <data key="d9">authority,decision</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-2b3a06f7135e2b57c94c1307b69cc5a4-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d11">网约公交客服管理·商户培训手册V20250905.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1779777466</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Lost Item" target="Standard Script">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Standard script is used to reassure passengers who have lost items, informing them that a search has been initiated.&lt;SEP&gt;Standard Script is used to comfort passengers reporting Lost Item complaints.</data>
